OL,3,AControversial Jackdaw gas field set to
OL,4,Abe approved in weeks, sources say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK government is set to give the
OL,7,Fgo-ahead for a controversial new gas
OL,8,Ffield off the coast of Aberdeen, the
OL,9,FBBC understands.
OL,11,FApproval for the Jackdaw project could
OL,12,Fcome in mid-September, just before
OL,13,FParliament breaks for party conference
OL,14,Fseason, according to government and
OL,15,Findustry sources.
OL,17,FThe gas field was approved by the
OL,18,Fformer Conservative government in 2022
OL,19,Fbut was delayed by a legal ruling from
OL,20,Fa Scottish court, after environmental
OL,21,Fgroups argued consent was given without
OL,22,Ffully considering the climate impact.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,109,105,200,300,0,100
