OL,3,AControversial Jackdaw gas field set to
OL,4,Abe approved in weeks, sources say
OL,5,
OL,6,FJackdaw's owner says it will account
OL,7,Ffor 6% of UK gas output when at peak
OL,8,Fproduction but environmental groups say
OL,9,Fit will provide only 2% of UK use when
OL,10,Fimports are included.
